{"screen_name": "bibibibirite", "file": "bibibibirite", "name": "ビスマス", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2026022303793090560/W3Gd3ol5.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/868952286449483777/1771876227/1500x500", "description": "illustrator/game creator/3D modeler 🚫AI\n◆mail: 83bismuthrite@gmail.com\n◆pixiv: https://www.pixiv.net/users/12118275\n◆skeb: http://skeb.jp/@bibibibirite", "total_works": 20, "scraped_works": 20, "first_seen": "2026-02-25T05:35:01.758620+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-11T02:26:40.154636+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 10000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-25T05:35:01.758620+00:00"}, {"amount": 23000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-25T12:25:44.573447+00:00"}, {"amount": 22000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-26T11:54:12.775717+00:00"}, {"amount": 14000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-26T21:23:27.635961+00:00"}, {"amount": 20000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-27T11:53:18.922257+00:00"}, {"amount": 17000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-27T17:44:19.872226+00:00"}, {"amount": 11000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-28T06:50:48.069975+00:00"}, {"amount": 9000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-08T01:29:36.227542+00:00"}, {"amount": 14000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-08T23:09:20.599444+00:00"}, {"amount": 20000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-09T09:45:20.272603+00:00"}, {"amount": 13000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-11T02:26:40.154636+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 13000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 9000, "max": 23000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/bibibibirite", "name": "bibibibirite"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/bismuthrite.bsky.social", "name": ""}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/12118275", "name": "12118275"}, {"label": "BOOTH", "url": "https://paravene.booth.pm", "name": "paravene"}], "flags": {}, "works": [{"path": "/@bibibibirite/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/eafdd8bb/uploads/origins/f1cc65c1-5848-4eb1-989a-ce40fdddfd63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04b181cd5507a7f4f9a1c64a50c0f7eb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eafdd8bb/uploads/origins/f1cc65c1-5848-4eb1-989a-ce40fdddfd63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04b181cd5507a7f4f9a1c64a50c0f7eb, https://si.imgix.net/eafdd8bb/uploads/origins/f1cc65c1-5848-4eb1-989a-ce40fdddfd63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=72f047bc536ff23e85219274e397294b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eafdd8bb/uploads/origins/f1cc65c1-5848-4eb1-989a-ce40fdddfd63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70a3bd051acfa982b42a4062918ff353 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "いつもお世話になります。\nもし宜しければ以下の通りお願いいたします。\nなお、「個人的にそういった画が見てみたい」だけで、「ビスマス様の世界観の中での実場面」を想定しているわけではありません（勝手にキャラを拝借してしまい恐縮です…）。\n\n※キャラと装備\n・獅童絢瀬さんで、制服姿。\n・左手は素の義手のまま、右手は極薄ゴム手袋着用。\n・左手については、もし可能であれば、義手の上に極薄ゴム手袋を着用した差分があると大変嬉しいです。\n\n※構図\n・獅童さんの状態（車椅子、車椅子以外の椅子等に座っている、立っている、等）はお任せ。\n・小～中型の自動拳銃（銃種はお任せ/未認可品を想定）に消音器をクルクルと捻じ込んでいるところ。\n\n※背景\n・完全にお任せいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@bibibibirite/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/833b3e5d/uploads/origins/51859033-4ceb-4c84-bcba-fda726734a85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b6ceb25bf508fa01b8f54f6f7af81fc0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/833b3e5d/uploads/origins/51859033-4ceb-4c84-bcba-fda726734a85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b6ceb25bf508fa01b8f54f6f7af81fc0, https://si.imgix.net/833b3e5d/uploads/origins/51859033-4ceb-4c84-bcba-fda726734a85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4dbbf6424b1728c093eb41b96882d420 2x, https://si.imgix.net/833b3e5d/uploads/origins/51859033-4ceb-4c84-bcba-fda726734a85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b28f12a4819b58de3341461f9f449b09 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello,\n\nI wanted to request your character Tsubasa Saeki in a skimpy outfit of some sort. Originally it was a cow bikini, but I’ll leave it up to you what outfit you’d like to draw. \n\nHer pose in the artwork will be holding her hair into twintails at the side of her head (like Eris Greyrat). She will have a tsundere expression, either frustrated, furious, or embarrassed. Your choice. Also, you can choose if you’d like her middle fingers to be extended while she holds her Twintails, doing the “fuck you” gesture.\n\nFor the second artwork, if it is okay, I would like you to draw Tsubasa (in the same outfit or a different one) again inflicting pain on a male’s testicles, if that is okay. The male will be unclothed, while Tsubasa will be mostly or fully clothed. I was thinking the scene would be a footjob that is very aggressive, maybe even with her shoes or boots on. I’ll let you decide the exact details of the position both characters are in, the viewpoint, and expression. And alternatively, if you have an idea that you’d like to draw instead that fits the specific SM I’m looking for, feel free to draw it instead as long as it’s CFNM.\n\nWith the little bit extra left behind, I’ll let you decide what you’d like to do. I think it’s too little for another artwork. But if it’s not, something with Kanzaki Aria in her micro bikini maid outfit (AmiAmi reference) would be cool, especially with her pistols out.\n\nIf not, just add some versions or draw whatever you like of Tsubasa.\n\nThank you", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@bibibibirite/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bcca0cef/uploads/origins/bbe0b260-4c12-4f07-bbc8-fcd39326da5e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a0ff744b188783b6d14e72ec6bf40a0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bcca0cef/uploads/origins/bbe0b260-4c12-4f07-bbc8-fcd39326da5e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a0ff744b188783b6d14e72ec6bf40a0, https://si.imgix.net/bcca0cef/uploads/origins/bbe0b260-4c12-4f07-bbc8-fcd39326da5e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d31ca2e1534cb8b4637ab2789e88871 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bcca0cef/uploads/origins/bbe0b260-4c12-4f07-bbc8-fcd39326da5e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=94c4d893f14fcf986bd2394d59535a67 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ビスマス様\nお世話になっております。\n\nこの度はうちの子のイラストを依頼したくリクエストいたしました。\n構図などはビスマス様にお任せします。\nご検討のほどよろしくお願い申し上げます。\n\nhttps://x.com/galerie407/status/1863591292397310438", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@bibibibirite/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/eb014faf/uploads/origins/5d2ed254-4029-487b-bab7-82cfc3d9ccb2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=999336ad8319e0f998473e51d59be2e0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eb014faf/uploads/origins/5d2ed254-4029-487b-bab7-82cfc3d9ccb2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=999336ad8319e0f998473e51d59be2e0, https://si.imgix.net/eb014faf/uploads/origins/5d2ed254-4029-487b-bab7-82cfc3d9ccb2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9c50680f0c7aa46b32d2994eca08bb9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eb014faf/uploads/origins/5d2ed254-4029-487b-bab7-82cfc3d9ccb2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=13183967d253454e192889fcf9377670 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "うちのこのタニア・バーレイをよろしくお願いします\n服装、髪型、シチュエーション、銃器や装備品等の有無など全て任せします。\n\nhttps://x.com/pup_kino6764/status/1808508404413112677?t=3QjQ0Lwh26EQUQoOfR9llA&s=19\n\nhttps://x.com/pup_kino6764/status/1896903864366076271?t=bDSiA30Bb8ESpzbU3qrYgg&s=19", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@bibibibirite/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d0d6dca7/uploads/origins/47696fce-e0cf-40b8-ad1c-d56e11dfa465?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bdb2a1fdc8b1629452bd9d0049204f9d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d0d6dca7/uploads/origins/47696fce-e0cf-40b8-ad1c-d56e11dfa465?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bdb2a1fdc8b1629452bd9d0049204f9d, https://si.imgix.net/d0d6dca7/uploads/origins/47696fce-e0cf-40b8-ad1c-d56e11dfa465?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=16f064ecfa3681eb5841dac862368d86 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d0d6dca7/uploads/origins/47696fce-e0cf-40b8-ad1c-d56e11dfa465?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0771157f949571721ce025e8b438dec7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "いつもお世話になります。\n毎回同じような内容で恐縮ですが、もし宜しければ以下の通りお願いいたします。\n\n※構図\n・床に倒れている人物に向けて撃ち込んでいる三廻部 エリのイメージで、全身が入るようにお願いします。\n・倒れている人物の描写は不要です。\n\n※キャラと装備\n・三廻部 エリで、服装と装備は過去作（https://skeb.jp/@bibibibirite/works/6）と全く同じでお願いします。\n・極薄ゴム手袋とシューズカバーもお願いします（好みの関係で申し訳ありません）。\n・素早く連射中で、2発目以降を発砲した瞬間（銃はフルにブローバック状態で、空薬莢がエジェクションポートそばと、さらに遠くの空中に飛んでいる）を希望します。\n・別人格の表情が本体に表出しているイメージ（本来では考えられないような表情をした本体）を希望します。\n・代わりに、背景等での別人格の描写は不要です。\n\n※背景\n・完全にお任せいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@bibibibirite/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ca1a63a8/uploads/origins/0fb17615-fb4a-415e-9713-8e6ac3c9bf2b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6f99314d9c4fe95c1367968a593fade", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ca1a63a8/uploads/origins/0fb17615-fb4a-415e-9713-8e6ac3c9bf2b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6f99314d9c4fe95c1367968a593fade, https://si.imgix.net/ca1a63a8/uploads/origins/0fb17615-fb4a-415e-9713-8e6ac3c9bf2b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7f8dbd44f3c0d4a173d2d2b2e9e18a3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ca1a63a8/uploads/origins/0fb17615-fb4a-415e-9713-8e6ac3c9bf2b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=00f28